    \"m_ObjectId\": \"d200589b044744aabee59db3e9cd1255\",\r\n    \"m_Title\": \"Toggle
    Workflows\",\r\n    \"m_Content\": \"CheckMetallic is a custom function node
    checking whether keyword _SPECULAR_SETUP is enabled. If it is enabled, the workflow
    is set to specular, the specular group of nodes will be used. Vise versa, if
    _SPECULAR_SETUP is disabled the metallic group of nodes will be used.\",\r\n   
    \"m_TextSize\": 0,\r\n    \"m_Theme\": 0,\r\n    \"m_Position\": {\r\n       
    \"serializedVersion\": \"2\",\r\n        \"x\": -176.0,\r\n        \"y\": -18.0,\r\n       
